menu "CampusPulse collector"
config CP_COLLECT_MAX_ADDRESSES
    int "Compiled maximum distinct addresses per window"
    range 1 512
    default 128
    help
        Build ceiling, not a collection policy or a measured radio capacity.
        Larger profiles need separately admitted address/bin banks and physical
        memory, queue and upload acceptance. Default C3 builds retain 128.
endmenu
